    {
      "id": "mechanism.65.longrange-attack-overlay.3890",
      "title": "远距攻击-xx：候选范围码并入范围块（叠加/替换）",
      "aliases": [
        "远距攻击",
        "long range attack overlay"
      ],
      "versions": [
        "6.5"
      ],
      "profile": "profile.ccz65.unencrypted.3890.scan",
      "status": "candidate",
      "evidence": "static-verified",
      "steps": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "entity": "fn.65.fatal-field-c-reader.3890",
          "role": "0x43F8C0 主范围 + 候选槽"
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "entity": "fn.65.longrange-effect-helper-9d.3890",
          "role": "0x9D 八向 → 候选 1"
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "entity": "fn.65.longrange-effect-helper-9e.3890",
          "role": "0x9E 没羽箭 → 候选 6"
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "entity": "fn.65.longrange-effect-chain.3890",
          "role": "0x9F..0xA4 首个 → 候选=参数值"
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "entity": "fn.65.attack-selector",
          "role": "0x45533D 读取 dword[unit+6] 范围块"
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "entity": "fn.65.attack-dispatch",
          "role": "0x436511 循环 4 槽逐码查 0x4D1400 并集"
        }
      ],
      "semantics": [
        "0x43F8C0 取主范围 [ebp-8] 后，把远距攻击候选码写入同一栈帧的 [ebp-7]/[ebp-6]/[ebp-5]；主范围再经 0x4E4000(6.5)/0x417A35(6.4)/0x417A38(6.6) 做等级拓展。",
        "叠加由范围块承载：unit+6 起最多 4 个范围码（dword）。0x45533D 读 dword[unit+6] 后交 0x436511。",
        "【已复核】0x436511 的模板索引公式：al=byte[范围块+i]，i<4 循环；al==0xFF 跳过；al==0 仅 i==0 有效；al>0x25 跳过；al==0x0A 走专用分支 0x437D10 后结束循环；al==0x0B 直接跳过；其余索引 idx = (al<0x0B ? al : al-2)，取 dword[0x4D1400+idx*4] 的 (dx,dy) 段，0xFFFF 终止，逐点 0x436616。",
        "0x436511 收尾把 0x4AC748 缓冲按 0x4B2C34 游标计数，并从起点扫描到 0xFF 或 byte==[0x4B2C28]，返回首个命中字节（单位号）；因此它同时承担「并集展开」与「取范围内首个合法目标」。",
        "单码或 [ebp+0xC]==0xFF 时走单范围分支，表现为替换而非叠加。",
        "6.4：0x43C794(unit,0x32,0,5) + 0x4079DA(unit,0x32)/(unit,0) 生成候选；6.6：0x45D47F（0x9B..0x9D）生成候选。"
      ],
